    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/d69b3e1f00cb17bd69dcacc35d1dbf95.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/d69b3e1f00cb17bd69dcacc35d1dbf95.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/d69b3e1f00cb17bd69dcacc35d1dbf95.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/edd49f23ae2d62ccbc1ea6680e2be02a.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/edd49f23ae2d62ccbc1ea6680e2be02a.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/edd49f23ae2d62ccbc1ea6680e2be02a.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In DreadRun, the game kicks off with the Exploration Phase, where you explore  the island , gathering valuable items to gear up for what\u2019s ahead. This phase sets the stage for the Payload Phase, the bullet hell action of the game, where you  face a fast-paced, action-packed challenge, navigating through a horde  of bullets, while trying to escort a payload till the end,  to emerge victorious.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/0878d2f08dcb6fb18cc506f8d891ba8c.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/0878d2f08dcb6fb18cc506f8d891ba8c.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/0878d2f08dcb6fb18cc506f8d891ba8c.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the Exploration Phase of DreadRun, your goal  is to quickly gather a variety of potions, superior weapon, and upgrades  before time runs out. Your adventure leads you through numerous randomly located  rooms on a vast island, with each session presenting new rooms and loot. The upgrades  you come across are random each time, making every game a distinct and exciting challenge. Utilize every second as efficiently as possible so that you will be prepared for what's  ahead<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/1c7f8acb5f08668decab9c5313e2319e.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/1c7f8acb5f08668decab9c5313e2319e.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/1c7f8acb5f08668decab9c5313e2319e.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After gearing up in the Exploration Phase, the Payload Phase of DreadRun is where the intense bullet hell  action unfolds. In this phase, you\u2019re challenged  with fighting off a swarm of enemies and  simultaneously escorting the payload to its  end  goal. As you advance, you\u2019ll encounter various enemy types that will try to block your path and make your mission tougher. It\u2019s a thrilling test of your combat skills and strategy as you push through to the end.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Team</h2></strong><br>This game is a college project made in less than 3 months by a team of passionate 6 developers, Avinash Prabhu, Somno, Hassan Abusalih, Dev Trivedi, Armaan Takyar and Armaan Sheikh<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/7539684d29a92d8768d937f05d813e16.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/7539684d29a92d8768d937f05d813e16.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/7539684d29a92d8768d937f05d813e16.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/d69b3e1f00cb17bd69dcacc35d1dbf95.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/d69b3e1f00cb17bd69dcacc35d1dbf95.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/d69b3e1f00cb17bd69dcacc35d1dbf95.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/edd49f23ae2d62ccbc1ea6680e2be02a.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/edd49f23ae2d62ccbc1ea6680e2be02a.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/edd49f23ae2d62ccbc1ea6680e2be02a.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In DreadRun, the game kicks off with the Exploration Phase, where you explore  the island , gathering valuable items to gear up for what\u2019s ahead. This phase sets the stage for the Payload Phase, the bullet hell action of the game, where you  face a fast-paced, action-packed challenge, navigating through a horde  of bullets, while trying to escort a payload till the end,  to emerge victorious.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/0878d2f08dcb6fb18cc506f8d891ba8c.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i