ss than 3 months by a team of passionate 6 developers, Avinash Prabhu, Somno, Hassan Abusalih, Dev Trivedi, Armaan Takyar and Armaan Sheikh<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/7539684d29a92d8768d937f05d813e16.poster.avif?t=1713470183\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/7539684d29a92d8768d937f05d813e16.webm?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895050/extras/7539684d29a92d8768d937f05d813e16.mp4?t=1713470183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
